            <ArticleTitle>Brain metastases: presentation, evaluation, and management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>120-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Brain metastases are a common and devastating consequence of cancer and carry a poor prognosis. Nevertheless, physicians can serve their patients well by suspecting, detecting, and treating them appropriately.</AbstractText>
